text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {R} for each Goblin on the battlefield.', 'All creatures able to block Taunting Elf do so.', 'All creatures attack each combat if able.\nAll creatures block each combat if able.', "All creatures gain fear until end of turn. (They can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nCycling {1}{B} ({1}{B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Dirge of Dread, you may have target creature gain fear until end of turn.", 'All creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Any number of target opponents each discard their hands, then draw seven cards.\nDraw a card.', 'As Circle of Solace enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\n{1}{W}: The next time a creature of the chosen type would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', "As Cover of Darkness enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nCreatures of the chosen type have fear. (They can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'As Doom Cannon enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature of the chosen type: Doom Cannon deals 3 damage to any target.', 'As Riptide Replicator enters the battlefield, choose a color and a creature type.\nRiptide Replicator enters the battlefield with X charge counters on it.\n{4}, {T}: Create an X/X creature token of the chosen color and type, where X is the number of charge counters on Riptide Replicator.', 'As Shared Triumph enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nCreatures of the chosen type get +1/+1.', "As Steely Resolve enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nCreatures of the chosen type have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nDestroy all creatures that share a creature type with the sacrificed creature. They can't be regenerated.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player gains control of Risky Move.\nWhen you gain control of Risky Move from another player, choose a creature you control and an opponent. Flip a coin. If you lose the flip, that opponent gains control of that creature.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, flip a coin. If you lose the flip, turn Skittish Valesk face down.\nMorph {5}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 5 or less life, you gain 3 life and draw a card.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have four or more creature cards in your graveyard, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 2 life.\nMorph {2}{B}{B} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile a creature card from a graveyard. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Entrails Feaster. If you don't, tap Entrails Feaster.", 'Barren Moor enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}.\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Chain of Plasma deals 3 damage to any target. Then that player or that permanent's controller may discard a card. If the player does, they may copy this spell and may choose a new target for that copy.", "Change the text of target spell or permanent by replacing all instances of one creature type with another. The new creature type can't be Wall. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", "Charging Slateback can't block.\nMorph {4}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", 'Choose a color. Creatures you control gain protection from the chosen color until end of turn.\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Choose a creature type other than Wall. Each creature becomes that type until end of turn.', 'Choose a creature type. If you control more creatures of that type than each other player, you gain control of all creatures of that type. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', "Choose any number of target players or planeswalkers. For each of them, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card, Kaboom! deals damage equal to that card's mana value to that player or planeswalker, then you put the revealed cards on the bottom of your library in any order.", "Choose any target. Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card. Erratic Explosion deals damage equal to that card's mana value to that permanent or player. Put the revealed cards on the bottom of your library in any order.", 'Choose one —\n• Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token.\n• Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.\n• Regenerate target Beast.', 'Choose one —\n• Destroy target Aura attached to a creature.\n• Target Soldier creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\n• Creatures you control gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Choose one —\n• Destroy target Cleric.\n• Return target Cleric card from your graveyard to your hand.\n• Target player loses 2 life.', 'Choose one —\n• Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\n• Target creature becomes the creature type of your choice until end of turn.\n• Look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Choose one —\n• Target creature gains haste until end of turn.\n• Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\n• Fever Charm deals 3 damage to target Wizard creature.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2} for each Wizard on the battlefield.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.\nCycling {2}{U} ({2}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Complicate, you may counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.', 'Counter target spell. Look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Creatures of the creature type of your choice get +0/+4 until end of turn.', 'Creatures of the creature type of your choice get +X/+X until end of turn.', 'Cycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Cycling {2}{G} ({2}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Krosan Tusker, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle. (Do this before you draw.)', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nMorph {4}{W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{G}, Sacrifice a Wall: Draw a card.", 'Destroy all artifacts, creatures, and enchantments.\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target creature with power 2 or less.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy target enchantment.', 'Destroy target land.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Destroy target non-Zombie creature. It can't be regenerated. Return up to one target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.", "Destroy target noncreature permanent. Then that permanent's controller may copy this spell and may choose a new target for that copy.", "Doubtless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Clerics on the battlefield.\nWhenever Doubtless One deals damage, you gain that much life.", 'Draw X cards. For each card drawn this way, discard a card unless you sacrifice a permanent.', 'Draw a card for each Bird on the battlefield.', 'Each other player discards a card. You draw a card for each card discarded this way.', "Each player chooses a creature type. Destroy all creatures that aren't of a type chosen this way. They can't be regenerated.", 'Each player chooses a creature type. Each player returns all creature cards of a type chosen this way from their graveyard to the battlefield.', "Each player discards a card. Then each player who didn't discard a creature card this way loses 4 life.", 'Each player may reveal any number of creature cards from their hand. Then each player creates a 2/2 green Bear creature token for each card they revealed this way.', 'Each player may search their library for up to X creature cards, reveal those cards, put them into their hand, then shuffle.', "Each player's life total becomes the number of creatures they control.", "Elven Riders can't be blocked except by Walls and/or creatures with flying.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has first strike.\nSacrifice Crown of Fury: Enchanted creature and other creatures that share a creature type with it get +1/+0 and gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.\nSacrifice Crown of Vigor: Enchanted creature and other creatures that share a creature type with it get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+5.\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/-1.\nSacrifice Crown of Suspicion: Enchanted creature and other creatures that share a creature type with it get +2/-1 until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +8/+8 and has trample.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "At the beginning of your upkeep, target opponent gains control of this creature unless you sacrifice a land."', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to target creature."\nAs long as enchanted creature is a Wizard, it has "{T}: This creature deals 2 damage to target creature."', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.\nSacrifice Crown of Ascension: Enchanted creature and other creatures that share a creature type with it gain flying until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has protection from black and from red.\nSacrifice Crown of Awe: Enchanted creature and other creatures that share a creature type with it gain protection from black and from red until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever a player cycles a card, put a plague counter on Withering Hex.\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-1 for each plague counter on Withering Hex.', 'Enchant creature\n{1}: Enchanted creature becomes the creature type of your choice until end of turn.', 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional {G} for each Elf on the battlefield.', 'Enchant land (Target a land as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that land.)\nEnchanted land is an Island.', 'Enchant land (Target a land as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that land.)\nYou control enchanted land.', 'Exile target attacking creature if its power is less than or equal to the number of Soldiers on the battlefield.', 'Exile target card from a graveyard.\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Face-down creature spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Face-down creatures get +1/+1.\n{2}{U}: Turn target face-down creature face up.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'First strike\nMorph {1}{R}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'First strike\nMorph {2}{W}{W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'First strike\nWhen Daru Cavalier enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a card named Daru Cavalier, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Flying\nAscending Aven can block only creatures with flying.\nMorph {2}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 cr