d.', '{T}: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "{T}: Draw three cards.\n{2}{U}{U}: Return Arcanis the Omnipotent to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Each player loses 1 life for each Zombie on the battlefield.', '{T}: Gravel Slinger deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.\nMorph {1}{W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{T}: Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of Wizards on the battlefield, then put them back in any order.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.\nMorph {W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{T}: Prevent the next X damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn, where X is the number of Clerics on the battlefield.', '{T}: Sparksmith deals X damage to target creature and X damage to you, where X is the number of Goblins on the battlefield.', '{T}: Target Elf or Soldier creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "{T}: Target creature with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Untap target artifact or creature.\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf on the battlefield.', '{U}, Sacrifice Riptide Chronologist: Untap all creatures of the creature type of your choice.', '{U}{U}, Sacrifice a Wizard: Counter target spell.\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{W}, {T}: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. Activate only if an opponent controls more lands than you.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.\nMorph {W} (You may cast this card face down